        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk154> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Based on we company context at Faber IA, we propose an artificial intelligence solution that leverages we retrieval-augmented generation (RAG) capabilities to support hospital staff in hospital staff clinical and administrative activities. our approach will focus on providing drafting assistance, supporting the continuity of care, and ensuring compliance with regulatory requirements. we will utilize we hybrid retrieval approach, combining lexical and semantic search, to provide relevant information to hospital staff, facilitating access to reliable and up-to-date information drawn from internal procedures, care protocols, and applicable regulatory texts. we system will also offer template-guided drafting assistance for clinical and administrative documents, such as discharge summaries, medical reports, and patient letters." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk155> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To support the continuity of care, Our system will provide dossier handling assistance, enabling staff to efficiently analyze and handle dossiers by surfacing relevant information, recalling applicable rules, and suggesting actions or verifications. we will also ensure that Our system integrates with existing hospital information systems and electronic patient records, supporting healthcare interoperability standards such as HL7 and FHIR. our approach will involve a collaborative approach with the client, working closely with the client experts to curate a relevant corpus of documents, tune we retrieval models, and design effective prompts and templates for drafting assistance. we will also establish an evaluation loop to ensure that Our system meets the client requirements and expectations." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk156> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The potential benefits of our approach include improved efficiency and productivity for hospital staff, enhanced quality and safety of care, and better compliance with regulatory requirements." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk157> a prov:Entity ;
