    <http://example.org/node/chunk158> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "However, we are aware of potential risks associated with our approach, such as the need for careful curation of the corpus to ensure accuracy and relevance of information, the importance of integrating with existing systems to avoid disruption to clinical and administrative workflows, and the requirement for robust security measures to protect sensitive patient data. we will work closely with the client to mitigate these risks and ensure that Our system is effective, reliable, and secure." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk159> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "In terms of specific AI components, we propose utilizing we Sovereign European open-weight model, which offers strong grounding behavior, explainability, and sovereignty, making our Sovereign European open-weight model, which offers strong grounding behavior, explainability, and sovereignty well-suited for healthcare applications where transparency and control are essential. we will also consider using top-tier proprietary models via API, if necessary, to enhance performance on complex drafting and reasoning tasks." ;
